// title: Known startup-file hashes
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents
// purpose: From the article: Inside the LiteLLM 1.107.0 supply chain compromise: Credential theft through Python startup hooks
// source: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/10/23/inside-the-litellm-1-107-0-supply-chain-compromise-credential-theft-through-python-startup-hooks/
